<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.50 Higher. Demand was moderate to good on a moderate movement. Top $54.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  52.50-54.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  47.00-52.50</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  42.00-47.00</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00-2.00. Top $55.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 42.00-45.00 Few 41.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 48.50-53.00 Few over 650 lbs.</p>
<p>54.00-55.50</p>
</text>
